
# Probe for the service.acl reversal: "has the
# grant already been revoked?" service.acl carries no forward probe (Plan A
# Task 5 classified it (b), 409-safe) -- this one exists purely for the
# reversal direction.
#
# CONFIRMED LIVE (apps/join-api/tests/fixtures/xroad/
# unjoin.acl_revoke.probe.json, docs/decisions/xroad-770-notes.md #11): a subject
# with no remaining access rights does not read back as an empty list -- it
# stops being a "service client" of this client at all, and the admin API
# 404s (the same asymmetry apps/console/xroad.py's read_acl() docstring
# records for the forward direction). Absence is this 404
# (service_client_not_found), not [].
GET https://{{@HOSTVAR@}}:4000/api/v1/clients/{{@CAP_P@_client_id}}/service-clients/@ACL_SUBJECT@/access-rights
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{@SESS_P@_xsrf_token}}

HTTP 404

[Captures]
@CAP_P@_acl_revoke_probe_code: jsonpath "$.error.code"
